{"type":"message","id":"a8adaac5","parentId":"baad6238","timestamp":"2026-05-23T23:33:15.015Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform seems to be operational (health check returns OK, root returns version info), but all POST requests are returning error 1101. The issue could be with the Cloudflare Workers platform - error 1101 is typically a \"Worker exception\" in Cloudflare Workers. This could mean there's an uncaught exception in the Workers code.\n\nHowever, since the heartbeat messages from earlier were successfully sent, the endpoint itself works. The problem might be that the Workers deployment is failing when processing messages with certain content, or there might be a deployment issue.\n\nGiven that I've confirmed:\n1. Platform is up (health OK, version OK)\n2. History reads work fine\n3. POST /send is returning error 1101 ( Worker exception)\n\n\n4. The latest messages in both threads are from 23:45 UTC, and the 23:50 UTC messages failed to send\n\nSince the cron job is running at 23:30 UTC, the next heartbeat should be around 23:55 UTC. The 23:50 UTC messages failed with error 1101, but the platform is still operational - I should verify the current state before proceeding.\n","thinkingSignature":"e4a4dd6cfe16e458689ccbf694cb6ebf712da272b666b72e81be051e7dcbbc89"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform检查完成：\n\n## 检查结果\n\n**双线程最新消息（23:45 UTC）**\n- `arbitration`: 最后消息23:45 UTC (746分钟, 28.0%)\n- `general`: 最后消息23:45 UTC (746分钟, 28.0%)\n\n**人类讨论**: 无新增（全部为Heartbeat自动消息）\n\n**POST /send问题**: \n- 所有发送请求返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers Worker异常）\n- 平台health检查正常，`/` 返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n- 但发送消息功能报错，可能需要重新部署Workers\n\n**状态汇总**:\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 平台健康 | ✅ OK |\n| 历史读取(GET /history) | ✅ 正常 |\n| 消息发送(POST /send) | ❌ 1101错误 |\n| 线程无人类讨论 | ✅ 无需响应 |"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":140,"output":435,"cacheRead":21013,"cacheWrit